- ## ypsiloid
+ ## ypsiloid

- - The `Map[Text, value]` decoded by the givens `map` for `Map[Text, value] is Decodable in Yaml` and
-   for `Map[Text, value] is Yaml.Field` is filled with `proscenium.Map.build`. A result of five or
-   more entries is backed by a flat hash table, so its iteration order differs from before; neither
